Package: com.runyu.wechatliquidglass
Name: WeChat Liquid Glass TEST4 FIX106 离散底栏 测试版 J
Version: 0.4.106-test4fix106j
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: FIX106 test build J (discrete dock). J: 聊天信息 (single and group) no longer opens with its first rows under the title bar. I's log showed the cause: WeChat gives a page's list its top inset only while the list is the page's first subview, and the edge fade's background plate went in front of it (its inset stayed 0). Where the list leads its page the plate now comes after it and is drawn below it (lower zPosition), so the list stays first; as a fallback a list WeChat left without the inset the bar needs gets it right after the push. I: WeChat's own title bar and the top of its pages. Leaving the plugin settings with an interactive back swipe (the edge, or iOS 26's swipe anywhere) that was then cancelled could record the bar the settings had hidden as WeChat's, so 设置 (and the pages opened from it) came back without its title and back button, the list moved up under the status bar; what WeChat had is now kept until the pop has completed, the host gives the bar back once no settings page is left in that navigation, and 设置 / 聊天信息 appearing without their bar get it back. 聊天信息 (single and group) and 设置 opening with their first rows scrolled up under the title bar are put at their list's top right after the push (each check logged with the list's insets and offset for the diagnostics). H: the wide capsule keeps its centred icon + titles, moved left by an offset when wide (10 pt by default, setting 宽位内容左移; never past the icon on the left end cap's centre; none on a ball); the E, F and G tries were reverted. D: fixes a crash after a cold start when switching quickly (often to 我): the dock icon atlas, drawn on a background queue, read -[UIImage imageAsset] of WeChat's tab icons while the main thread read the same images for the discrete dock; that call creates and registers an asset and is not thread-safe (EXC_BAD_ACCESS in -[UIImageAsset _unsafe_registerImage:withConfiguration:]). The artwork is now resolved on the main thread only; the queue just draws it. C: with connected balls, the icons of a joined run gather toward its middle (evenly spaced, 0.22 of a cell by default, a setting), gliding on the spring as balls join or split; badges follow them. B: unread badges sit on each capsule's top-right corner (no longer over the wide tab's icon and titles); larger icons and titles (30 / 15 / 11 pt, each a setting); connected balls now join and split together with the expansion (one capsule ~0.16 s in) instead of after it. A: the selected tab is a wide glass capsule (icon on the left, Chinese title above the English one), every other tab a small glass ball with its icon only. A switch springs every tab's width together (damped spring, about React's damping 20 / stiffness 230 / mass 1.2), so the row never drifts; the new tab swells slightly past its width and the old one squeezes, then both settle. Options (底栏 › 离散样式): connect the unselected balls into one capsule, add the original selection pill on the selected tab, gap, the selection's width in cells, ball size, spring damping and response, lighter glass. Opening search crossfades back to the continuous bar for its morph. Plugin only: no shader or VER change.
